@startuml sd_us110
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US110 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "ATCC" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of airports-routes" as EAR
box "airports-routes-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "RouteController" as RouteController
participant "CreateRouteUseCase" as CreateRouteUseCase
database "own database" as DBAR
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as OBAR
end box
collections "peer replicas\nairports-routes-m" as PAR
== POST /api/routes ==
Actor -> EAR : POST /api/routes\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAR -> RouteController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
RouteController -> CreateRouteUseCase : execute(...)
CreateRouteUseCase -> DBAR : origin and destination already here?
opt not found here
CreateRouteUseCase -> PAR : GET /internal/routes/{origin}/{destination}\n(asks the peers)
PAR --> CreateRouteUseCase : 200 / 404
end
CreateRouteUseCase -> DBAR : airports (catalog, complete here)
CreateRouteUseCase -> DBAR : save route + copy for the next replica in the outbox\n(same transaction)
CreateRouteUseCase --> RouteController : created
RouteController --> Actor : 201 Created
OBAR -> PAR : PUT /internal/replicas/routes\n(to the next replica in the ring, retried until delivered)
PAR --> OBAR : 200 (applied if newer)
@enduml
